Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 13:58:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] fix(desktop): settle catch-up text before remounting a
 live conversation

Switching back to a live session captured the leftover prefix as
settledText, then painted the seed catch-up through the per-frame
display batch. useStreamingText treated that as a new stream. Hold
the live bubble until Runtime Host has seeded, apply those deltas
immediately, and snapshot the full buffer in the same activation.

Fixes #3044

