Subject: [PATCH 2/4] fix(desktop): bind live catch-up readiness to observation
 generation
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

sessionId plus a monotonic revision let A → B → A reuse the previous
ready seed, and Host recovery replayed catch-up without a new renderer
seed boundary. Key pending and ready to each observation generation,
including subscription recovery and candidate restore.

Fixes #3044

